steak: So anyway. Time to get serious considering I don’t have much time left here.
if {EntreeKeep} == "Brock":
	character: Seriously? Aw, man. Are all you people short-lived like this?
else:
	character: Seriously? But Shizuka had so long, why were you only here for like half an hour?
steak: Naw. Some of us get longer than others; it’s just fate.
character: That… That sucks!
steak: Not really.
character: Yes, it does! Aren’t you… dying, or something?
steak: Naw? What made you think that?
if {EntreeKeep} == "Brock":
	character: Gee, maybe the fact that both you and Brock
else:
	character: Shizuka said that your time was up!
steak: Well… it is. It’s not like we’re dead, though.
character: So what happens after you poof out of existence, then!? You experience nirvana, maybe reach enlightenment with Buddha?
steak: We go into a purgatory-like waiting room until ya’ decide to pull us out again.
character: …Huh? I can do that?
steak: How else do you think we came to life?
character: I just figured the magic I got struck with was doing… magic, I don’t know!
steak: Yeah, well… Now you do know.
character: Uh-huh, right. I’m going to assume that bringing you out of purgatory is what I’m doing when I cook you.
steak: Yep!
character: Sick. Okay, well… I guess I’ll see you later then, partner.
steak: Catch you ‘round, partner!
leave steak [animation="Fade Out" length="2.0" wait="true"]
audio music "res://dialogic resources/voices/Blip.wav" [loop="false"]
[end_timeline]